{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
After standing still for {c_number}{SF_23}{/c} |4second:seconds;, summon a skull for {c_number}{SF_1}{/c} seconds that rotates around you and breathes fire that Burns enemies for {c_random}{dot:BURNING_TOOLTIP}{/c} damage over {c_number}{SF_3}{/c} seconds.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if}

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Enemies take {c_random}[{SF_11}*100|1x%|]{/c} more damage from your Damage over Time effects.{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
